outputs/
└── f7e8d9c0b1a2/              ← job ID, one per Convert click
    ├── glb/
    │   └── mymodel.glb
    ├── fbx/
    │   └── mymodel.fbx
    ├── gltf/
    │   ├── mymodel.gltf       ← GLTF writes several files,
    │   ├── mymodel.bin          so the engine also builds
    │   └── mymodel_gltf.zip     a ZIP of them
    └── HK3D_converted.zip     ← made only when you tap DOWNLOAD ALL
